.Sp
Bug Tracker: <https://bugs.launchpad.net/stellarium>
.IP "The Stellarium User Guide" 4
.IX Item "The Stellarium User Guide"
Visit the downloads page to get a PDF copy of the Stellarium User Guide.
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.IX Header "BUGS"
Please report bugs using the bug tracker link in the NOTES section 
of this page.
